  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000810020,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "やっぱり、一流の芸能人は\r\n身の回りのものだって一級品じゃないとね！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100081/1802001000810020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たしかに、いい鞄だな\r\n今の服装にもよく似合ってるし",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "こだわりを\r\n大事にしよう",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000811"
  },
  {
    "select": "かなの家は\r\nお金持ちなのか？",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000812"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "ただ、普段使いには\r\n適さないかもな",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000813"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000810030,
    "label": "1802001000811",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "この業界はイメージが大事じゃない？\r\nいつ誰に見られてるかわからないからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100081/1802001000810030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000810040,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "それにお気に入りの鞄を持つと\r\n楽しい気分になるじゃない",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100081/1802001000810040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000810050,
    "label": "1802001000812",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "どういう意味？\r\nもしかして親に買ってもらったと思ってる？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100081/1802001000810050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000810060,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "これでも一応\r\n売れっ子の子役だったんだから",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
